    "description": "Control of an unstable inverted pendulum balanced on a moving cart. State variables are angle θ(t) and angular velocity θ̇(t). Using state variable feedback u(t) = -K x(t), the closed-loop system is stabilized. For ω_n=10 and ζ=0.8, gains satisfy k2/l = -16 and (k1+g)/l = 100, yielding percent overshoot 1.5% and settling time 0.5 s.",
